BUNDLED IN THIS REPOSITORY

Fourteen font families
  assets/fonts/*.ttf

  Inter, Lato, Montserrat, Noto Sans, Open Sans, Oswald, Poppins, PT Sans,
  Raleway, Source Sans 3, Lora, Playfair Display and JetBrains Mono are each
  under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. Roboto is under the Apache
  License 2.0. Every copyright line, and the full OFL text, is reproduced in
  assets/fonts/OFL.txt, which scripts/build-fonts.mjs regenerates from the
  upstream packages. That script REFUSES TO BUILD if a package ships no licence
  file, so a font can never end up here without its notice.

  Shipped in the repository rather than fetched at runtime because the rendering
  service has no system fonts, so PNG and WebP output would have nothing to draw
  text with. These are SUBSET to the Latin ranges by the same script, which
  OFL-1.1 permits as a Modified Version; the files keep their original family
  names because subsetting removes glyphs without redesigning any. None of them
  is sold on its own.

Lucide
  src/icons.generated.ts
  Copyright (c) for portions of Lucide are held by Cole Bemis 2013-2022 as part
  of Feather (MIT). All other copyright (c) for Lucide are held by Lucide
  Contributors 2022.
  ISC License. https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide/blob/main/LICENSE

  The generated file holds the inner geometry of each icon, extracted from the
  lucide-static package by scripts/build-icons.mjs. lucide-static itself is a
  devDependency and is not part of the deployed service: the generated file is
  committed so a fresh clone builds without it.

